THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
----------------------

This repository contains no third-party source code. It references the
following independently-licensed projects, each of which remains under its own
license and is NOT covered by the terms above:

  - bnb-chain/tss-lib (MIT) — resolved as a Go module dependency by
    adapters/tss-lib; its source is not included here.

  - Three-Round-Multiparty-ECDSA (MIT) — built separately; the orchestrator
    executes its `trecdsa-eval` binary as a subprocess.

  - BICYCL (GNU GPL v3.0 or later) — a submodule of
    Three-Round-Multiparty-ECDSA, reached only through that project.

Distributing binaries built from those projects carries their licensing
obligations — in particular, a `trecdsa-eval` binary links BICYCL and is
therefore subject to the GPL. Those obligations attach to such binaries, not to
the source in this repository.
